   "text": "University of Illinois Springfield - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUniversity of Illinois Springfield\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nThe University of Illinois Springfield (UIS) is a public university in Springfield, Illinois. The university was established in 1969 as Sangamon State University by the Illinois General Assembly and became a part of the University of Illinois system on July 1, 1995. As a public liberal arts college, and the newest campus in the University of Illinois system, UIS is a member of the Council of Public Liberal Arts Colleges. UIS is also part of the American Association of State Colleges and Universities and the American Council on Education. The campus' main repository, Brookens Library, holds a collection of nearly 800,000 books and serials in addition to accessible resources at the University of Illinois Chicago and University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign campuses.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n21/04/2026 05:55\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n21/04/2026 05:55\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited States\nYearly Fees\nMax: US$40,000.00\nMin: US$19,000.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n10%\n415 of 4,150 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nShorelight Education\nFounded Year\n1969\nCampus(es)\nSpringfield, IL\nCountry\nUnited States\nExcluded Countries\nUnited States\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n09/07/2025\nContract End Date\n01/01/2070\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\n-\nScholarship Offered\nWhen applying to UIS, all undergraduate freshmen are automatically eligible for Lincoln Merit Scholarships. These scholarships are automatically applied upon admission and are based solely on GPA.\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5XNnmBp0zdU\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
